// C keeps gifsicle's state in globals (`gtst`, `gtmsgs`, `def_frame`, `active_output_data`, the
// parser, the input). Here it is one value, `Gt`, which every function that reads or changes it
// is lent; the streams, images and colormaps live in its lists (see gif.sg).

